1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,460 --> 00:01:38,940
=Episode 10=

4
00:01:39,780 --> 00:01:41,780
There was a farmer who lived
in the mountains of Lingnan.

5
00:01:42,540 --> 00:01:44,260
He was short and weak,

6
00:01:45,260 --> 00:01:47,260
and farmed a few small plots alone.

7
00:01:49,020 --> 00:01:49,580
One day,

8
00:01:49,820 --> 00:01:51,820
some villagers came running in a panic.

9
00:01:52,980 --> 00:01:54,220
They told him they had often spotted

10
00:01:55,060 --> 00:01:56,460
a giant python nearby,

11
00:01:57,580 --> 00:02:00,340
over three zhang,
covered in bright scales.

12
00:02:00,940 --> 00:02:02,780
And it'd devoured
many travelers and horses.

13
00:02:03,940 --> 00:02:06,020
They urged him to move elsewhere.

14
00:02:06,820 --> 00:02:07,700
But he said nothing.

15
00:02:09,580 --> 00:02:12,460
Did he have a secret way
to kill the python?

16
00:02:14,860 --> 00:02:16,140
After hearing about it,

17
00:02:16,620 --> 00:02:18,820
he spent day and night
pondering how to kill it.

18
00:02:20,020 --> 00:02:22,180
They said it moved like the wind.

19
00:02:22,740 --> 00:02:24,460
Even a galloping horse
couldn't outrun it.

20
00:02:25,100 --> 00:02:26,420
Its body was covered in hard scales,

21
00:02:26,820 --> 00:02:27,620
impervious to attacks.

22
00:02:30,140 --> 00:02:31,860
Victory seemed impossible.

23
00:02:32,260 --> 00:02:33,260
The villagers might not even survive.

24
00:02:34,780 --> 00:02:35,380
And then?

25
00:02:36,060 --> 00:02:37,820
He kept racking his brains

26
00:02:38,220 --> 00:02:39,660
but never found a solution.

27
00:02:40,340 --> 00:02:41,460
He simply farmed every day,

28
00:02:41,980 --> 00:02:43,940
working at sunrise
and returning at sunset.

29
00:02:44,700 --> 00:02:45,460
Until one day,

30
00:02:47,540 --> 00:02:48,980
after harvesting all his rice,

31
00:02:49,900 --> 00:02:52,500
he was so exhausted
that he fell asleep on a field ridge.

32
00:02:53,700 --> 00:02:54,900
When he finally awoke,

33
00:02:55,300 --> 00:02:56,260
he found the python

34
00:02:57,420 --> 00:02:59,020
had already swallowed both his legs.

35
00:03:01,660 --> 00:03:02,780
When a python catches live prey,

36
00:03:03,500 --> 00:03:05,180
it usually constricts it to death first.

37
00:03:06,460 --> 00:03:07,460
But he'd been fast asleep,

38
00:03:07,820 --> 00:03:08,980
so the python took him for dead

39
00:03:09,740 --> 00:03:10,940
and slowly swallowed him.

40
00:03:12,380 --> 00:03:13,740
Then how did he survive?

41
00:03:15,060 --> 00:03:16,500
How do you know he survived?

42
00:03:17,220 --> 00:03:18,580
Or who else would be telling the story?

43
00:03:18,900 --> 00:03:19,540
The python?

44
00:03:21,940 --> 00:03:22,540
Until then,

45
00:03:22,860 --> 00:03:23,900
he'd pondered day and night

46
00:03:24,580 --> 00:03:26,180
but couldn't figure out what to do.

47
00:03:26,780 --> 00:03:27,460
Then,

48
00:03:28,300 --> 00:03:30,900
just as the python had swallowed him
up to the waist,

49
00:03:31,740 --> 00:03:32,700
he suddenly sat up

50
00:03:33,620 --> 00:03:34,780
and snapped its spine.

51
00:03:35,420 --> 00:03:36,540
He grabbed the sickle beside him,

52
00:03:36,860 --> 00:03:37,980
thrust it into the snake's mouth,

53
00:03:39,340 --> 00:03:40,540
and slit its throat.

54
00:03:40,860 --> 00:03:41,740
So he killed the python?

55
00:03:46,340 --> 00:03:48,220
One year, I went hunting with my brother

56
00:03:48,820 --> 00:03:49,780
and we passed his thatched cottage.

57
00:03:50,860 --> 00:03:52,300
He was already an old man by then.

58
00:03:53,020 --> 00:03:54,300
He told us the story himself.

59
00:03:55,820 --> 00:03:56,500
The snake's skin

60
00:03:57,340 --> 00:03:58,140
hung on his wall.

61
00:04:00,140 --> 00:04:00,820
So, Your Highness,

62
00:04:01,700 --> 00:04:03,660
there's no need to worry or rush.

63
00:04:04,500 --> 00:04:05,660
Since we're outmatched

64
00:04:06,300 --> 00:04:07,020
and can't fight back,

65
00:04:07,900 --> 00:04:09,100
let's wait and see.

66
00:04:10,140 --> 00:04:11,380
Even if we do nothing,

67
00:04:12,260 --> 00:04:13,060
that python

68
00:04:13,780 --> 00:04:15,900
will eventually expose
its vulnerable throat.

69
00:04:16,860 --> 00:04:17,900
There's only one thing

70
00:04:19,100 --> 00:04:19,780
you need to do:

71
00:04:20,660 --> 00:04:21,260
Wait.

72
00:04:23,660 --> 00:04:24,140
And perhaps

73
00:04:24,980 --> 00:04:26,460
endure.

74
00:04:27,700 --> 00:04:29,980
Even with the python
swallowing your legs,

75
00:04:31,420 --> 00:04:32,860
you must act as if nothing's wrong.

76
00:04:33,340 --> 00:04:33,860
Pretend

77
00:04:34,540 --> 00:04:35,500
you're still fast asleep.

78
00:04:40,700 --> 00:04:41,420
I see.

79
00:04:44,020 --> 00:04:44,500
Yan Shang.

80
00:04:45,060 --> 00:04:46,340
You're still quite the storyteller.

81
00:04:57,180 --> 00:04:57,580
Let's go.

82
00:04:58,500 --> 00:05:00,540
This house won't be ready
until tomorrow.

83
00:05:01,020 --> 00:05:02,060
No one can stay here tonight.

84
00:05:12,940 --> 00:05:14,020
So that residence

85
00:05:14,340 --> 00:05:15,860
is linked to yours by waterways,

86
00:05:16,300 --> 00:05:17,420
and the gates face each other in a maze?

87
00:05:18,860 --> 00:05:19,980
After going around in circles,

88
00:05:20,220 --> 00:05:21,580
I could barely tell where I was.

89
00:05:21,740 --> 00:05:22,580
Walk around a few more times,

90
00:05:22,740 --> 00:05:23,500
and you'll get the hang of it.

91
00:05:24,380 --> 00:05:28,220
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

92
00:05:50,140 --> 00:05:51,700
What brings you here so late?

93
00:05:53,060 --> 00:05:54,020
I need to talk to you.

94
00:05:55,700 --> 00:05:56,300
It's so late.

95
00:05:56,740 --> 00:05:57,500
Why is he still here?

96
00:05:58,940 --> 00:05:59,700
What's it to you?

97
00:06:02,860 --> 00:06:03,380
You may go back.

98
00:06:05,460 --> 00:06:05,740
Wait.

99
00:06:07,380 --> 00:06:09,340
Why the rush, Mr. Yan?

100
00:06:11,340 --> 00:06:12,580
I'll be frank with you, Mr. Yang.

101
00:06:13,140 --> 00:06:14,620
I'm now Her Highness's male favorite,

102
00:06:14,980 --> 00:06:16,020
and she pays me a monthly stipend.

103
00:06:16,580 --> 00:06:18,420
I must obey Her Highness's orders.

104
00:06:19,260 --> 00:06:20,220
So I can't stay.

105
00:06:20,580 --> 00:06:20,940
You...

106
00:06:28,900 --> 00:06:29,660
Aren't you going back?

107
00:06:30,180 --> 00:06:30,940
How many times must I tell you?

108
00:06:31,700 --> 00:06:32,660
The imperial exam is just days away.

109
00:06:33,260 --> 00:06:34,540
Aren't you studying tonight?

110
00:06:35,260 --> 00:06:35,580
Got it.

111
00:06:44,420 --> 00:06:45,420
Do you even know this man?

112
00:06:45,700 --> 00:06:46,500
And you're letting him stay here?

113
00:06:47,740 --> 00:06:48,700
I hired him for his looks.

114
00:06:50,020 --> 00:06:51,140
Why should it matter

115
00:06:51,500 --> 00:06:52,340
whether I know him?

116
00:06:53,380 --> 00:06:55,060
I'm just afraid
he'll take you for a ride.

117
00:06:56,340 --> 00:06:58,060
Thanks for your concern, Mr. Yang.

118
00:07:03,100 --> 00:07:03,460
Wanyao,

119
00:07:05,220 --> 00:07:06,140
who were you protecting

120
00:07:08,420 --> 00:07:09,140
with that lie today?

121
00:07:12,780 --> 00:07:13,740
Did the Crown Prince tell you?

122
00:07:14,460 --> 00:07:15,500
Answer me, Wanyao.

123
00:07:15,740 --> 00:07:16,780
I can't.

124
00:07:18,340 --> 00:07:18,780
Yang Si.

125
00:07:19,820 --> 00:07:20,700
I can only tell you one thing.

126
00:07:21,580 --> 00:07:22,180
Before,

127
00:07:22,900 --> 00:07:24,740
I couldn't protect those I wanted to.

128
00:07:25,700 --> 00:07:27,780
But now I can, so I did.

129
00:07:37,500 --> 00:07:38,500
If I'm right,

130
00:07:39,940 --> 00:07:41,380
court investigators will take over

131
00:07:41,860 --> 00:07:43,380
Zhang Renjing's murder case tomorrow.

132
00:07:44,900 --> 00:07:46,460
You won't be able to pursue it anymore.

133
00:07:47,340 --> 00:07:47,940
So,

134
00:07:48,620 --> 00:07:49,500
will you still interrogate me?

135
00:07:54,140 --> 00:07:55,540
Go ahead and protect those you want to.

136
00:07:57,420 --> 00:07:58,140
I'll protect you.

137
00:08:00,500 --> 00:08:01,140
That works for me.

138
00:08:07,460 --> 00:08:07,900
Yang Si!

139
00:08:11,900 --> 00:08:13,180
Come to my residence tomorrow.

140
00:08:13,620 --> 00:08:15,820
I'll borrow your carriage
to see the Crown Prince.

141
00:08:18,540 --> 00:08:21,700
(Chongli Hall)

142
00:08:27,580 --> 00:08:28,020
What's the matter?

143
00:08:30,180 --> 00:08:30,580
Your Royal Highness,

144
00:08:31,180 --> 00:08:31,940
Princess Danyang is here.

145
00:08:41,060 --> 00:08:41,460
Wanyao,

146
00:08:42,780 --> 00:08:43,820
why didn't you tell me beforehand

147
00:08:44,620 --> 00:08:45,700
you were bringing a stranger?

148
00:08:46,300 --> 00:08:46,660
Xun,

149
00:08:47,220 --> 00:08:47,940
this is Yan Shang.

150
00:08:48,580 --> 00:08:50,140
He's the real killer of Zhang Renjing.

151
00:08:54,580 --> 00:08:55,380
Greetings, Your Royal Highness.

152
00:08:56,220 --> 00:08:57,340
This isn't the Court of Judicial Review.

153
00:08:58,380 --> 00:08:59,300
Guilty or innocent,

154
00:08:59,900 --> 00:09:00,500
I don't care.

155
00:09:15,180 --> 00:09:16,500
Yan Shang came to Sheng'an

156
00:09:17,500 --> 00:09:18,340
with no rank,

157
00:09:18,660 --> 00:09:19,420
no possessions.

158
00:09:20,060 --> 00:09:21,340
He used Grand Princess Luling

159
00:09:21,460 --> 00:09:22,660
and the Peony Festival

160
00:09:23,100 --> 00:09:24,980
to plot Zhang Renjing's murder.

161
00:09:26,100 --> 00:09:27,820
He's now living at my residence

162
00:09:28,420 --> 00:09:29,420
and serving as my adviser.

163
00:09:30,620 --> 00:09:33,140
He'll help you with your plans
from now on.

164
00:09:34,860 --> 00:09:36,420
I'm grateful for Her Highness's trust.

165
00:09:36,940 --> 00:09:38,860
I'll serve Your Royal Highness
with all my heart.

166
00:09:40,460 --> 00:09:42,140
A man of courage and cunning,

167
00:09:42,820 --> 00:09:44,420
I truly admire you.

168
00:09:53,660 --> 00:09:55,940
Since I've decided to join you
in our great cause,

169
00:09:56,300 --> 00:09:57,260
there are no secrets between us.

170
00:09:58,420 --> 00:09:59,460
Those at my side

171
00:10:00,060 --> 00:10:00,980
are at yours as well.

172
00:10:05,180 --> 00:10:05,540
Wanyao,

173
00:10:06,380 --> 00:10:06,940
I'll drink to you.

174
00:10:08,060 --> 00:10:08,780
Between us,

175
00:10:09,220 --> 00:10:10,220
there should be such honesty.

176
00:10:37,820 --> 00:10:39,100
You little brat, what's so funny?

177
00:10:40,460 --> 00:10:41,700
I'm happy for you.

178
00:10:42,300 --> 00:10:43,860
You got your money's worth
with this house.

179
00:10:52,180 --> 00:10:52,860
Yan Shang!

180
00:10:53,220 --> 00:10:53,940
Chunhua!

181
00:10:54,900 --> 00:10:55,700
Don't call him.

182
00:10:56,780 --> 00:10:57,700
Let him study in peace.

183
00:11:54,540 --> 00:11:55,580
Wei Shu, why the daydreaming?

184
00:11:57,340 --> 00:11:58,020
I was wondering

185
00:11:58,620 --> 00:12:00,140
how much sulfur to use.

186
00:12:01,380 --> 00:12:02,900
Stop thinking about such nonsense.

187
00:12:03,060 --> 00:12:04,340
The exam's in two days,

188
00:12:04,340 --> 00:12:05,380
yet you haven't opened a book.

189
00:12:07,780 --> 00:12:08,460
Then...

190
00:12:09,740 --> 00:12:10,940
what should I read?

191
00:12:14,060 --> 00:12:14,380
Fine.

192
00:12:15,260 --> 00:12:16,140
Figure it out yourself.

193
00:12:16,420 --> 00:12:17,420
I'll be up all night studying.

194
00:12:40,740 --> 00:12:41,940
Your imperial exams are tomorrow.

195
00:12:42,340 --> 00:12:42,940
Are you nervous?

196
00:12:44,900 --> 00:12:45,340
Forget it.

197
00:12:45,900 --> 00:12:47,140
You'd never admit it anyway.

198
00:12:50,180 --> 00:12:51,500
That's not why I came here.

199
00:12:52,260 --> 00:12:53,220
Whether I pass or fail,

200
00:12:53,780 --> 00:12:54,380
it doesn't matter.

201
00:12:55,180 --> 00:12:55,860
Doesn't matter?

202
00:12:57,020 --> 00:12:58,740
Then how do you plan to make a living
in Sheng'an?

203
00:13:02,900 --> 00:13:05,060
By being your male favorite, of course.

204
00:13:06,580 --> 00:13:07,420
I'm not arguing with you.

205
00:13:13,140 --> 00:13:14,060
Are you free tonight?

206
00:13:15,660 --> 00:13:16,020
Why?

207
00:13:16,900 --> 00:13:18,020
I'm hosting a dinner at my residence.

208
00:13:18,380 --> 00:13:19,380
I'd like you and Wei Shu to join me.

209
00:13:21,060 --> 00:13:21,700
What a shame.

210
00:13:22,380 --> 00:13:23,740
I have plans tonight.

211
00:13:27,020 --> 00:13:29,380
Your Highness, I went to see Wei Shu.

212
00:13:29,580 --> 00:13:31,380
He said he had plans and couldn't come.

213
00:13:36,780 --> 00:13:43,680
(Moonlight Pavilion)

214
00:13:46,340 --> 00:13:47,660
The moon is bright tonight,

215
00:13:47,940 --> 00:13:48,620
but sadly, not quite full.

216
00:13:49,540 --> 00:13:52,020
Liu Wenji, don't say
such ill-omened things.

217
00:13:53,020 --> 00:13:53,740
In tomorrow's exam,

218
00:13:54,020 --> 00:13:55,580
all four of us will enjoy full success!

219
00:13:57,460 --> 00:13:58,940
Yes. My mistake.

220
00:13:59,700 --> 00:14:00,380
(Moonlight Pavilion)
It's all Yan Shang's fault!

221
00:14:00,740 --> 00:14:02,300
He's always busy with who knows what.

222
00:14:02,700 --> 00:14:04,620
Only today
did he introduce me to you all.

223
00:14:06,700 --> 00:14:07,620
It's just as well the moon isn't full.

224
00:14:08,140 --> 00:14:08,860
For what waxes must wane.

225
00:14:09,340 --> 00:14:10,180
Liu Wenji. Feng Xianyu.

226
00:14:10,940 --> 00:14:11,380
Not quite.

227
00:14:11,820 --> 00:14:14,180
Waxing and waning are just appearances.

228
00:14:14,940 --> 00:14:15,500
The moon itself

229
00:14:16,180 --> 00:14:17,180
has never changed.

230
00:14:19,620 --> 00:14:19,980
Wei Shu,

231
00:14:20,820 --> 00:14:21,340
I don't get it.

232
00:14:23,100 --> 00:14:25,260
Liu Wenji, that's for the best.

233
00:14:26,020 --> 00:14:27,660
If Wei Shu starts explaining,

234
00:14:27,980 --> 00:14:29,420
none of us can sleep tonight.

235
00:14:34,260 --> 00:14:35,060
Are you asleep, Yan Shang?

236
00:14:37,460 --> 00:14:38,660
I'm listening to you all talk.

237
00:14:39,140 --> 00:14:40,340
It feels so peaceful.

238
00:14:41,180 --> 00:14:42,020
Life is short.

239
00:14:42,660 --> 00:14:44,740
The moon was like this generations ago.

240
00:14:45,260 --> 00:14:46,060
And generations later,

241
00:14:46,540 --> 00:14:47,740
it will still look the same.

242
00:14:48,660 --> 00:14:50,620
But we'll all be dust by then.

243
00:14:51,180 --> 00:14:52,380
Yet tonight, we're here,

244
00:14:52,700 --> 00:14:54,860
sharing tea and admiring the moon.

245
00:14:55,420 --> 00:14:57,300
Isn't that wonderful?

246
00:14:59,860 --> 00:15:00,260
Indeed.

247
00:15:01,020 --> 00:15:02,100
It's truly wonderful!

248
00:15:03,820 --> 00:15:05,700
Wenji was my only friend before.

249
00:15:06,420 --> 00:15:07,740
Now, in Sheng'an, I've met all of you.

250
00:15:08,260 --> 00:15:08,780
When I think about it,

251
00:15:09,860 --> 00:15:10,700
I'm truly lucky.

252
00:15:13,140 --> 00:15:13,820
My dear friends,

253
00:15:14,660 --> 00:15:17,060
I never had friends before either.

254
00:15:19,620 --> 00:15:20,380
When we part tonight,

255
00:15:20,820 --> 00:15:21,900
whatever fate has in store for us,

256
00:15:22,300 --> 00:15:24,220
I hope we'll be friends for life.

257
00:15:24,780 --> 00:15:25,060
Come on!

258
00:15:25,580 --> 00:15:25,860
Cheers!

259
00:15:41,380 --> 00:15:45,020
(Examination Hall)

260
00:15:52,420 --> 00:15:57,220
(Examination Hall)

261
00:16:01,900 --> 00:16:02,260
Thank you.

262
00:16:07,860 --> 00:16:08,460
(Examination Hall)
(Let's go, Wei Shu.)

263
00:16:16,620 --> 00:16:20,380
(Examination Hall)

264
00:16:20,380 --> 00:16:20,780
(My lady!)

265
00:16:24,540 --> 00:16:28,860
(Examination Hall)

266
00:16:28,860 --> 00:16:33,820
(Half a month later)

267
00:16:48,620 --> 00:16:49,060
What's wrong?

268
00:16:50,060 --> 00:16:50,980
You bet on all the wrong candidates?

269
00:16:53,060 --> 00:16:53,820
Want to see?

270
00:16:54,860 --> 00:16:55,700
Let's see

271
00:16:56,060 --> 00:16:57,020
what rank you got.

272
00:16:58,980 --> 00:16:59,780
I'm an examinee.

273
00:17:00,140 --> 00:17:01,140
I shouldn't look at this.

274
00:17:02,020 --> 00:17:03,140
Besides, before the results
are announced,

275
00:17:03,700 --> 00:17:04,940
not a single name on this list

276
00:17:05,460 --> 00:17:06,340
is set in stone.

277
00:17:08,420 --> 00:17:08,980
True.

278
00:17:09,620 --> 00:17:11,740
These rankings are based
on the exam alone.

279
00:17:12,340 --> 00:17:13,500
No one's tampered with them yet.

280
00:17:14,740 --> 00:17:15,860
Now that the list is out,

281
00:17:16,340 --> 00:17:17,900
who knows how many hands
it'll pass through?

282
00:17:18,860 --> 00:17:20,580
Everyone will want to rig the rankings.

283
00:17:21,380 --> 00:17:22,580
By the time the results are announced,

284
00:17:23,700 --> 00:17:25,380
who knows what the list will look like?

285
00:17:32,780 --> 00:17:33,460
(Still...)

286
00:17:33,820 --> 00:17:35,100
(my luck with these bets)

287
00:17:36,100 --> 00:17:36,940
(is almost too good.)

288
00:17:36,940 --> 00:17:42,180
(1st: Wei Shu, 2nd: Li Wenqing,
3rd: Yan Shang)

289
00:17:46,500 --> 00:17:47,660
You're in a good mood.

290
00:17:48,020 --> 00:17:49,140
Has someone on this list

291
00:17:49,140 --> 00:17:50,740
caught your eye?

292
00:17:50,740 --> 00:17:51,980
(1st: Wei Shu, 2nd: Li Wenqing,
3rd: Yan Shang)

293
00:17:51,980 --> 00:17:53,180
I'd be unhappy if they had.

294
00:17:53,860 --> 00:17:55,300
It's more fun when they haven't.

295
00:17:56,100 --> 00:17:56,660
When they haven't?

296
00:17:58,580 --> 00:17:59,340
I've recently spotted

297
00:17:59,740 --> 00:18:01,420
a promising young man.

298
00:18:02,300 --> 00:18:03,220
He's got some backbone,

299
00:18:04,020 --> 00:18:04,660
but not much.

300
00:18:06,380 --> 00:18:08,020
All he needs is this piece of paper.

301
00:18:11,780 --> 00:18:14,220
But you've already taken in so many men.

302
00:18:18,780 --> 00:18:19,220
I see.

303
00:18:20,180 --> 00:18:21,100
They're all mediocre now.

304
00:18:21,420 --> 00:18:22,620
Not worth your attention.

305
00:18:34,100 --> 00:18:35,060
Go to the Imperial Academy

306
00:18:35,340 --> 00:18:36,460
and summon Feng Xianyu.

307
00:18:38,220 --> 00:18:39,340
Tell him...

308
00:18:41,620 --> 00:18:44,460
(3rd: Yan Shang)

309
00:18:45,500 --> 00:18:46,100
Tell him

310
00:18:47,060 --> 00:18:48,980
I'll make him the third place.

311
00:18:50,700 --> 00:18:51,060
Understood.

312
00:18:56,460 --> 00:19:01,380
(Grand Princess Luling's Residence)

313
00:19:36,020 --> 00:19:40,900
(1st: Wei Shu, 2nd: Li Wenqing,
3rd: Yan Shang)

314
00:19:45,820 --> 00:19:49,340
(3rd: Yan Shang)

315
00:20:05,380 --> 00:20:07,020
Please help me, Your Highness.

316
00:20:09,620 --> 00:20:12,600
(Writing and Ink)

317
00:20:17,660 --> 00:20:19,100
(After I'm gone...)

318
00:20:19,260 --> 00:20:20,580
(Cao Miaozhen, Feng Xianyu's wife)

319
00:20:20,580 --> 00:20:21,500
(our daughter...)

320
00:20:22,740 --> 00:20:25,380
(will have only you to rely on...)

321
00:20:35,740 --> 00:20:37,620
May you...

322
00:20:39,220 --> 00:20:43,300
take the top spot...

323
00:20:44,660 --> 00:20:45,260
Miaozhen!

324
00:20:45,540 --> 00:20:46,380
I did it...

325
00:20:49,660 --> 00:20:50,740
I did it...

326
00:20:52,220 --> 00:20:53,420
I did it!

327
00:20:56,060 --> 00:20:58,220
I did it!

328
00:21:04,700 --> 00:21:07,180
(I did it!)

329
00:21:26,180 --> 00:21:27,020
It's only been half a day,

330
00:21:28,220 --> 00:21:30,580
and the names have changed
several times.

331
00:21:31,220 --> 00:21:33,300
No matter how gifted you are,

332
00:21:33,940 --> 00:21:35,140
without powerful backing,

333
00:21:36,020 --> 00:21:37,660
you're just duckweed adrift.

334
00:21:38,740 --> 00:21:39,860
You drift through Sheng'an,

335
00:21:40,460 --> 00:21:41,100
and just like that,

336
00:21:41,500 --> 00:21:42,460
you're gone.

337
00:21:45,980 --> 00:21:48,420
(1st: Wei Shu, 2nd: Li Wenqing,
3rd: Feng Xianyu)

338
00:21:50,260 --> 00:21:51,500
(3rd: Feng Xianyu)

339
00:21:52,860 --> 00:21:54,780
Wasn't the original third place...

340
00:21:54,980 --> 00:21:55,700
It was Wanyao's male favorite,

341
00:21:56,620 --> 00:21:57,740
Yan Shang from Lingnan.

342
00:21:58,500 --> 00:21:59,460
What good is passing the exam?

343
00:22:00,300 --> 00:22:01,700
Wanyao can barely protect herself.

344
00:22:02,540 --> 00:22:03,700
How could she protect anyone else?

345
00:22:04,540 --> 00:22:06,100
One word from Grand Princess Luling,

346
00:22:06,700 --> 00:22:08,100
and his name was struck off.

347
00:22:12,380 --> 00:22:12,900
Still...

348
00:22:15,100 --> 00:22:17,020
who am I to mock her?

349
00:22:18,220 --> 00:22:19,820
As long as Yu Cheng'an is around,

350
00:22:21,620 --> 00:22:23,500
I'm in no position to feel safe either.

351
00:22:29,340 --> 00:22:30,540
Your Highness, Mr. Yang is here.

352
00:22:32,060 --> 00:22:33,380
Why did the Crown Prince send you here?

353
00:22:33,500 --> 00:22:34,660
Am I only here because he sent me?

354
00:22:35,220 --> 00:22:35,980
Can't we meet

355
00:22:36,140 --> 00:22:37,500
for our own reasons?

356
00:22:39,180 --> 00:22:40,180
All right.

357
00:22:40,460 --> 00:22:41,540
What brings you here, then?

358
00:22:42,620 --> 00:22:43,940
Yan Shang is no longer the third place.

359
00:22:46,780 --> 00:22:47,340
Who did it?

360
00:22:48,540 --> 00:22:49,220
Grand Princess Luling

361
00:22:49,220 --> 00:22:50,460
struck his name off herself,

362
00:22:51,340 --> 00:22:52,540
and replaced it with Feng Xianyu.

363
00:22:53,340 --> 00:22:55,460
I hear he's her latest favorite.

364
00:23:01,380 --> 00:23:02,260
Thanks for telling me.

365
00:23:04,340 --> 00:23:05,780
Should I thank Yan Shang, then?

366
00:23:06,100 --> 00:23:07,940
He's given me an excuse to see you.

367
00:23:08,300 --> 00:23:09,500
Enough with the sarcasm.

368
00:23:10,020 --> 00:23:11,340
Since when did you get so sharp-tongued?

369
00:23:12,980 --> 00:23:13,380
That's enough.

370
00:23:13,700 --> 00:23:14,140
I'm leaving.

371
00:23:20,540 --> 00:23:21,220
She holds considerable power.

372
00:23:22,140 --> 00:23:23,220
Don't confront her head-on.

373
00:23:23,540 --> 00:23:24,060
Yang Si,

374
00:23:24,700 --> 00:23:25,620
I'm not a fool.

375
00:23:26,860 --> 00:23:27,580
Yan Shang alone

376
00:23:28,180 --> 00:23:29,740
isn't worth offending
Grand Princess Luling.

377
00:23:33,820 --> 00:23:34,500
Besides,

378
00:23:36,020 --> 00:23:37,060
given my position,

379
00:23:38,180 --> 00:23:38,940
even if I wanted to,

380
00:23:41,060 --> 00:23:42,020
what could I do to her?

381
00:23:51,780 --> 00:23:54,020
(Calligraphy)

382
00:24:13,300 --> 00:24:13,700
Your Highness.

383
00:24:14,780 --> 00:24:15,660
Don't stop on my account.

384
00:24:15,860 --> 00:24:16,540
Keep writing.

385
00:24:17,500 --> 00:24:18,500
I just came to have a look.

386
00:24:29,140 --> 00:24:31,260
(Calligraphy)

387
00:24:38,740 --> 00:24:40,220
Back in Lingnan,

388
00:24:41,300 --> 00:24:43,420
I was so scared of bugs
I couldn't sleep.

389
00:24:44,740 --> 00:24:45,580
I'd run out

390
00:24:46,660 --> 00:24:47,740
and find you writing in the courtyard.

391
00:24:48,580 --> 00:24:49,700
I was amazed back then.

392
00:24:50,540 --> 00:24:51,900
In such a remote village,

393
00:24:52,700 --> 00:24:54,700
someone could actually read and write.

394
00:24:55,900 --> 00:24:57,380
That was quite a feat.

395
00:24:57,380 --> 00:24:58,460
(Calligraphy)

396
00:25:06,220 --> 00:25:06,660
Have you come

397
00:25:07,340 --> 00:25:08,980
with news about the exam?

398
00:25:10,820 --> 00:25:11,780
Why would it be about the exam?

399
00:25:12,140 --> 00:25:13,180
The results come out tomorrow.

400
00:25:14,020 --> 00:25:14,820
At a time like this,

401
00:25:15,260 --> 00:25:17,380
if you rush over looking so hesitant,

402
00:25:18,140 --> 00:25:19,300
it can only be about that.

403
00:25:23,060 --> 00:25:23,980
Did I fail?

404
00:25:30,100 --> 00:25:30,540
Then...

405
00:25:31,420 --> 00:25:32,740
my name must've been replaced.

406
00:25:37,700 --> 00:25:38,140
It's all right.

407
00:25:39,700 --> 00:25:41,380
I didn't come to Sheng'an for the exam.

408
00:25:42,540 --> 00:25:43,980
Even as your adviser,

409
00:25:44,340 --> 00:25:45,660
I don't need to make the list.

410
00:25:47,300 --> 00:25:47,660
Your Highness,

411
00:25:48,380 --> 00:25:49,020
you don't need to

412
00:25:49,940 --> 00:25:50,660
comfort me.

413
00:25:53,780 --> 00:25:54,220
Yan Shang,

414
00:25:54,660 --> 00:25:56,020
do you know why you failed?

415
00:25:57,220 --> 00:25:58,980
Your classmate Feng Xianyu

416
00:25:58,980 --> 00:26:00,140
went to Grand Princess Luling.

417
00:26:00,300 --> 00:26:01,100
One word from her,

418
00:26:01,660 --> 00:26:02,660
and he became the third place!

419
00:26:05,820 --> 00:26:06,700
I'm no match for her.

420
00:26:07,300 --> 00:26:08,300
So you had to fail!

421
00:26:20,740 --> 00:26:21,180
Your Highness.

422
00:26:23,580 --> 00:26:24,300
Don't take it to heart.

423
00:26:25,020 --> 00:26:25,820
Don't be sad.

424
00:26:26,340 --> 00:26:27,500
You've done more than enough for me.

425
00:26:28,100 --> 00:26:28,860
If you're feeling hurt,

426
00:26:29,540 --> 00:26:30,220
or angry about this,

427
00:26:31,100 --> 00:26:32,580
I can walk around the courtyard with you

428
00:26:33,180 --> 00:26:33,740
to help you clear your head.

429
00:26:34,100 --> 00:26:34,860
I'm not upset!

430
00:26:35,380 --> 00:26:36,180
Why would I be?

431
00:26:37,260 --> 00:26:37,700
Why would I need comfort

432
00:26:37,700 --> 00:26:38,980
from an exam failure like you?

433
00:26:44,580 --> 00:26:45,620
Your Highness, wait!

434
00:26:46,180 --> 00:26:46,580
Your Highness!

435
00:26:46,820 --> 00:26:47,340
How dare you!

436
00:26:48,260 --> 00:26:48,820
Where are you going?

437
00:26:49,180 --> 00:26:50,700
Do I have to report
my every move to you?

438
00:26:50,940 --> 00:26:51,580
Are you going to the palace,

439
00:26:52,180 --> 00:26:53,220
or Grand Princess Luling's residence?

440
00:26:54,060 --> 00:26:54,540
Or...

441
00:26:55,660 --> 00:26:56,660
are you going to see Yu Cheng'an?

442
00:26:56,820 --> 00:26:58,220
I'll go wherever I please.

443
00:26:58,820 --> 00:26:59,460
What's it to you?

444
00:27:00,740 --> 00:27:01,140
Your Highness,

445
00:27:02,340 --> 00:27:03,180
in Sheng'an,

446
00:27:03,780 --> 00:27:04,780
nothing comes for free.

447
00:27:05,540 --> 00:27:07,060
Everything has a price.

448
00:27:08,180 --> 00:27:09,020
I'm not worth the sacrifice.

449
00:27:09,780 --> 00:27:10,220
Yan Shang,

450
00:27:11,780 --> 00:27:12,660
don't tell me what to do.

451
00:27:13,540 --> 00:27:14,780
You don't get to decide what's worth it.

452
00:27:16,860 --> 00:27:18,940
They wronged me, not you.

453
00:27:19,900 --> 00:27:20,700
All these years,

454
00:27:21,100 --> 00:27:22,700
I've backed down time and again.

455
00:27:23,540 --> 00:27:25,340
After Lingnan, I made up my mind.

456
00:27:26,300 --> 00:27:27,900
I refuse to live like this anymore!

457
00:27:28,940 --> 00:27:29,820
Listen carefully.

458
00:27:30,340 --> 00:27:31,820
You're mine now.

459
00:27:32,900 --> 00:27:35,020
We'll share both honor and disgrace.

460
00:27:36,460 --> 00:27:38,460
But if you have no rank or title,

461
00:27:39,460 --> 00:27:40,300
how can you help me?

462
00:27:40,740 --> 00:27:41,740
How will you survive in Sheng'an?

463
00:27:42,060 --> 00:27:42,820
What good are you to me?

464
00:27:46,180 --> 00:27:47,340
Ten years of hard study,

465
00:27:48,820 --> 00:27:49,700
all for an empty dream.

466
00:27:51,300 --> 00:27:51,900
Yan Shang,

467
00:27:53,420 --> 00:27:55,020
don't tell me you're content with this.

468
00:27:59,780 --> 00:28:04,420
♪We weren't born for sacrifice.
Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

469
00:28:04,620 --> 00:28:07,140
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

470
00:28:07,300 --> 00:28:10,820
♪Cold as a blade,
yet peerless as a bloom♪

471
00:28:10,940 --> 00:28:11,420
Your Highness...

472
00:28:11,420 --> 00:28:13,820
♪Who dares make me bow
down in the dust?♪

473
00:28:13,820 --> 00:28:14,540
Does this...

474
00:28:14,540 --> 00:28:16,940
♪With sacrificed innocence
and a soul snowbound♪

475
00:28:16,940 --> 00:28:18,020
... really have to be settled?

476
00:28:18,220 --> 00:28:18,540
Yes!

477
00:28:18,540 --> 00:28:20,540
♪If the road is blocked,
I'll fight my way through♪

478
00:28:20,620 --> 00:28:21,340
Do you remember...

479
00:28:21,340 --> 00:28:22,740
♪Cut down the crowd,
strike down the proud gods♪

480
00:28:22,740 --> 00:28:24,060
... the story I told
about the giant python

481
00:28:24,940 --> 00:28:26,460
when we first came here?

482
00:28:28,280 --> 00:28:29,580
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

483
00:28:29,580 --> 00:28:30,020
Your Highness,

484
00:28:31,540 --> 00:28:33,180
we're still waiting for the python

485
00:28:33,940 --> 00:28:34,940
to expose its throat.

486
00:28:36,660 --> 00:28:39,220
If we anger the Grand Princess,
Yu Cheng'an will catch wind of it.

487
00:28:40,820 --> 00:28:41,660
It's not time yet.

488
00:28:42,420 --> 00:28:45,420
♪Though this world is hard to cross,
I'll lead you through♪

489
00:28:45,420 --> 00:28:46,060
Please, endure this a little longer.

490
00:28:46,340 --> 00:28:49,420
♪I dare face the unknown,
with my sword in hand♪

491
00:28:49,660 --> 00:28:55,860
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers,
breach the city gates♪

492
00:28:55,860 --> 00:28:57,220
We'll find another way

493
00:28:58,660 --> 00:28:59,980
without alerting the python.

494
00:29:07,020 --> 00:29:08,500
There is indeed another way.

495
00:29:08,500 --> 00:29:11,060
♪A tooth for a tooth♪

496
00:29:11,060 --> 00:29:12,740
Whoever started it must end it.

497
00:29:12,740 --> 00:29:16,580
♪A scar for a scar♪

498
00:29:16,580 --> 00:29:19,900
♪One song of slaughter follows another♪

499
00:29:24,260 --> 00:29:24,900
- (Yan Shang.)
- (Yan Shang.)

500
00:29:25,860 --> 00:29:26,180
(Yan Shang.)

501
00:29:26,700 --> 00:29:27,020
(Yan Shang.)

502
00:29:27,300 --> 00:29:27,660
(Yan Shang.)

503
00:29:30,540 --> 00:29:30,980
(Yan Shang.)

504
00:29:38,860 --> 00:29:39,220
Yan Shang.

505
00:29:40,220 --> 00:29:40,580
Wei Shu.

506
00:29:41,260 --> 00:29:42,460
Have you seen Feng Xianyu today?

507
00:29:42,820 --> 00:29:43,860
I've searched everywhere for him.

508
00:29:44,980 --> 00:29:45,860
You're too late.

509
00:29:46,340 --> 00:29:47,580
He's seeing someone off
outside the south gate.

510
00:29:48,020 --> 00:29:49,260
He left a quarter of an hour ago.

511
00:29:50,260 --> 00:29:50,660
Thank you.

512
00:29:54,180 --> 00:29:54,580
How did it go?

513
00:29:55,060 --> 00:29:55,380
Let's go.

514
00:29:56,180 --> 00:29:56,740
To the south gate!

515
00:29:57,740 --> 00:30:00,780
(Imperial Academy)

516
00:30:07,540 --> 00:30:08,500
(Mingde Gate)
When you get home,

517
00:30:09,500 --> 00:30:10,820
take care of the old house and farmland.

518
00:30:12,100 --> 00:30:13,340
And find someone to raise Guiniang well.

519
00:30:13,740 --> 00:30:15,500
(Guiniang, Feng Xianyu's daughter)
Give her a good life from now on.

520
00:30:16,260 --> 00:30:17,340
I'll send money home every month.

521
00:30:20,100 --> 00:30:20,460
Farewell.

522
00:30:32,900 --> 00:30:33,780
Father!

523
00:30:35,980 --> 00:30:37,100
Father, don't go!

524
00:30:37,820 --> 00:30:39,140
I'll behave!

525
00:30:40,540 --> 00:30:42,900
Father, don't leave me!

526
00:30:53,780 --> 00:30:54,340
(Father...)

527
00:30:54,340 --> 00:30:55,220
Shall we follow Mr. Feng?

528
00:30:57,740 --> 00:30:57,980
No.

529
00:30:58,860 --> 00:30:59,660
Go after the old servant.

530
00:31:00,700 --> 00:31:00,980
(Got it.)

531
00:31:09,740 --> 00:31:10,060
Sir,

532
00:31:10,500 --> 00:31:10,820
please wait.

533
00:31:18,380 --> 00:31:18,980
Who are you?

534
00:31:19,340 --> 00:31:20,420
I'm Feng Xianyu's classmate.

535
00:31:21,220 --> 00:31:22,780
This must be his little girl.

536
00:31:23,580 --> 00:31:24,340
I believe we've met once.

537
00:31:26,140 --> 00:31:27,740
It's getting dark. Where are you going?

538
00:31:28,420 --> 00:31:29,020
I have a carriage.

539
00:31:29,580 --> 00:31:31,020
Let me give you a ride.

540
00:31:32,180 --> 00:31:33,380
Thank you for your kindness, sir.

541
00:31:34,300 --> 00:31:35,140
It's too far.

542
00:31:35,660 --> 00:31:36,380
You can't take us all the way.

543
00:31:36,980 --> 00:31:38,460
We are heading home

544
00:31:38,740 --> 00:31:40,380
(Feng family's old servant)
to Luzhou.

545
00:31:42,180 --> 00:31:43,260
You were doing just fine.

546
00:31:43,820 --> 00:31:44,820
Why leave so suddenly?

547
00:31:46,380 --> 00:31:47,340
Who knows?

548
00:31:47,860 --> 00:31:48,620
To be honest,

549
00:31:49,220 --> 00:31:50,180
my master

550
00:31:50,660 --> 00:31:51,220
has spent years

551
00:31:51,860 --> 00:31:53,060
taking the exams in Sheng'an.

552
00:31:54,060 --> 00:31:55,060
The family's savings

553
00:31:55,780 --> 00:31:56,380
are all gone.

554
00:31:57,260 --> 00:31:58,900
His wife just passed away.

555
00:32:00,460 --> 00:32:01,820
And now his little girl

556
00:32:02,420 --> 00:32:03,860
is going home with an old man like me.

557
00:32:04,900 --> 00:32:06,820
Who knows how we'll get by?

558
00:32:11,340 --> 00:32:11,620
Sir,

559
00:32:12,500 --> 00:32:13,540
please wait.

560
00:32:16,740 --> 00:32:17,100
Fang Tong,

561
00:32:17,900 --> 00:32:18,900
did you bring any money?

562
00:32:19,420 --> 00:32:20,260
Could you lend me some?

563
00:32:37,300 --> 00:32:37,900
Don't forget to pay me back.

564
00:32:38,460 --> 00:32:38,860
Of course.

565
00:32:40,220 --> 00:32:41,660
What good will a few coins do?

566
00:32:43,300 --> 00:32:43,660
Here, take this.

567
00:32:54,580 --> 00:32:54,940
Thank you!

568
00:33:02,100 --> 00:33:02,380
Sir.

569
00:33:02,380 --> 00:33:03,260
Oh...

570
00:33:04,500 --> 00:33:05,100
This little sum

571
00:33:05,580 --> 00:33:06,260
is to cover your travel expenses.

572
00:33:06,700 --> 00:33:07,820
With an old man and a little girl

573
00:33:08,260 --> 00:33:08,860
traveling so far after dark,

574
00:33:09,140 --> 00:33:09,860
please take extra care.

575
00:33:11,260 --> 00:33:11,620
Take it.

576
00:33:15,500 --> 00:33:17,180
Keep this money safe.

577
00:33:17,660 --> 00:33:18,740
Don't let anyone see it.

578
00:33:19,260 --> 00:33:20,860
When you get home, buy a few more acres.

579
00:33:21,260 --> 00:33:21,620
That way,

580
00:33:22,180 --> 00:33:22,780
you can support yourselves.

581
00:33:24,100 --> 00:33:25,460
No, we can't accept this!

582
00:33:26,500 --> 00:33:26,940
Sir,

583
00:33:27,700 --> 00:33:29,660
we're strangers to you.

584
00:33:30,220 --> 00:33:30,500
This...

585
00:33:30,740 --> 00:33:31,660
You've misunderstood, sir.

586
00:33:32,060 --> 00:33:33,100
I'm Feng Xianyu's friend.

587
00:33:35,780 --> 00:33:36,260
Please take it.

588
00:33:40,980 --> 00:33:41,300
Guiniang,

589
00:33:41,780 --> 00:33:42,900
go on, thank this gentleman.

590
00:33:42,980 --> 00:33:44,620
Thank you, sir.

591
00:33:49,580 --> 00:33:50,020
Guiniang,

592
00:33:51,580 --> 00:33:52,900
you have quite a few flowers
in your hair.

593
00:33:53,740 --> 00:33:55,140
Can I have one?

594
00:33:55,860 --> 00:33:56,460
Sure.

595
00:34:01,540 --> 00:34:02,260
Thank you, Guiniang.

596
00:34:08,500 --> 00:34:10,060
Why take a flower from a little girl?

597
00:34:11,180 --> 00:34:11,620
Your Highness,

598
00:34:12,420 --> 00:34:13,420
you should go home now.

599
00:34:16,900 --> 00:34:18,100
You're off to do something wicked,

600
00:34:18,380 --> 00:34:19,140
and I shouldn't watch?

601
00:34:20,740 --> 00:34:21,700
Best not to watch.

602
00:34:22,660 --> 00:34:24,700
It can't be worse than murder, can it?

603
00:34:25,820 --> 00:34:27,340
If you kill Feng Xianyu on the spot,

604
00:34:27,820 --> 00:34:28,500
first,

605
00:34:28,700 --> 00:34:30,420
I'll cheer you on.

606
00:34:30,900 --> 00:34:31,300
Second,

607
00:34:31,660 --> 00:34:32,780
I can help cover it up, can't I?

608
00:34:33,940 --> 00:34:36,020
Anyway, we've done this before.

609
00:34:38,060 --> 00:34:38,380
Let's go.

610
00:34:38,780 --> 00:34:39,500
Find Feng Xianyu.

611
00:34:40,820 --> 00:34:43,140
(Silk Road Pavilion)

612
00:34:43,140 --> 00:34:43,460
Your Highness.

613
00:34:44,940 --> 00:34:45,500
(This way.)

614
00:34:45,500 --> 00:34:45,820
(This place...)

615
00:34:46,700 --> 00:34:47,580
(Cuiyun Tower)
(Careful.)

616
00:34:47,940 --> 00:34:48,380
(Careful, sir.)

617
00:34:48,380 --> 00:34:50,300
Move. It's not a den of tigers.

618
00:34:50,580 --> 00:34:51,460
(Take care!)

619
00:34:52,540 --> 00:34:54,180
Ma'am, please wait.

620
00:34:54,540 --> 00:34:57,260
Wh-what brings you here?

621
00:34:57,420 --> 00:34:58,580
Not me.

622
00:34:59,300 --> 00:35:00,340
My husband wanted to come.

623
00:35:03,860 --> 00:35:04,220
That's right.

624
00:35:04,820 --> 00:35:05,660
It was my own idea to come.

625
00:35:07,540 --> 00:35:08,820
Well...

626
00:35:09,140 --> 00:35:10,540
Are you going in with him?

627
00:35:11,300 --> 00:35:11,820
Of course.

628
00:35:12,740 --> 00:35:14,340
My husband wants to visit a brothel.

629
00:35:14,740 --> 00:35:16,140
So naturally, I'll keep an eye on him.

630
00:35:16,980 --> 00:35:17,300
Move aside.

631
00:35:17,340 --> 00:35:20,020
(Cuiyun Tower)

632
00:35:20,020 --> 00:35:22,220
(Well, I've seen it all now!)

633
00:35:25,420 --> 00:35:25,820
(Sir!)

634
00:35:27,980 --> 00:35:28,500
(Bravo!)

635
00:35:30,180 --> 00:35:30,660
(Bravo!)

636
00:35:31,580 --> 00:35:32,140
(Careful.)

637
00:35:34,660 --> 00:35:35,300
(Let's go!)

638
00:35:39,260 --> 00:35:41,420
Have you been here before?

639
00:35:42,620 --> 00:35:42,980
I have.

640
00:35:44,180 --> 00:35:44,660
That day,

641
00:35:44,980 --> 00:35:47,260
Wei Shu and I followed Feng Xianyu here.

642
00:35:47,780 --> 00:35:48,260
(Come on!)

643
00:35:48,580 --> 00:35:50,900
That Feng guy really is a scoundrel!

644
00:36:06,300 --> 00:36:07,140
(Bravo!)

645
00:36:07,700 --> 00:36:08,900
(Bravo!)

646
00:36:13,460 --> 00:36:15,500
(Bravo!)

647
00:36:17,300 --> 00:36:17,660
Thank you.

648
00:36:31,580 --> 00:36:32,140
Feng Xianyu,

649
00:36:33,180 --> 00:36:34,020
you're drunk

650
00:36:34,780 --> 00:36:35,540
and don't even recognize me?

651
00:36:37,780 --> 00:36:38,500
Of course I do.

652
00:36:40,180 --> 00:36:41,020
I'll take my leave.

653
00:36:43,780 --> 00:36:45,060
Feng Xianyu, why the rush?

654
00:36:46,620 --> 00:36:48,140
I've come to congratulate you.

655
00:36:50,860 --> 00:36:51,860
You're joking, Yan Shang.

656
00:36:52,940 --> 00:36:53,900
What's there to celebrate?

657
00:36:54,140 --> 00:36:55,580
You've taken the third place.

658
00:36:56,500 --> 00:36:57,740
Isn't that worth celebrating?

659
00:37:04,100 --> 00:37:05,580
You're here to demand justice?

660
00:37:08,500 --> 00:37:09,940
You know better than I do.

661
00:37:11,300 --> 00:37:12,740
Justice and fairness

662
00:37:13,620 --> 00:37:14,900
lie in the hearts.

663
00:37:15,220 --> 00:37:15,700
Yan Shang,

664
00:37:17,820 --> 00:37:18,900
say what you came to say.

665
00:37:19,980 --> 00:37:21,300
Stop pretending!

666
00:37:26,540 --> 00:37:28,140
If I said it here,

667
00:37:29,260 --> 00:37:29,780
Feng Xianyu,

668
00:37:30,580 --> 00:37:32,340
your reputation would be ruined.

669
00:38:01,820 --> 00:38:03,300
(Bravo!)

670
00:38:28,260 --> 00:38:28,940
Yan Shang,

671
00:38:30,340 --> 00:38:31,420
cut the act.

672
00:38:34,020 --> 00:38:35,220
You think my hands are dirty.

673
00:38:35,900 --> 00:38:36,900
But are yours clean?

674
00:38:38,340 --> 00:38:39,420
I rely on the powerful.

675
00:38:40,540 --> 00:38:41,860
But are you any more above reproach?

676
00:38:42,500 --> 00:38:43,620
I knew what was on the list.

677
00:38:44,220 --> 00:38:45,020
And so did you.

678
00:38:45,020 --> 00:38:46,460
Why else would you accuse me?

679
00:38:48,300 --> 00:38:50,100
You have Princess Danyang backing you.

680
00:38:50,380 --> 00:38:51,300
But who do I have?

681
00:38:54,700 --> 00:38:55,340
Feng Xianyu,

682
00:38:56,580 --> 00:38:57,980
you must've gone to great lengths

683
00:38:59,060 --> 00:39:00,140
to get that place, right?

684
00:39:05,660 --> 00:39:06,260
It doesn't matter.

685
00:39:12,820 --> 00:39:14,580
I don't care at all.

686
00:39:15,620 --> 00:39:16,700
Once the results are posted tomorrow,

687
00:39:17,420 --> 00:39:18,900
you'll be nothing.

688
00:39:24,140 --> 00:39:25,420
I used to think

689
00:39:26,900 --> 00:39:27,900
we were friends.

690
00:39:28,220 --> 00:39:29,780
And you came here to say this?

691
00:39:30,180 --> 00:39:31,780
Did you ever consider me a friend?

692
00:39:35,140 --> 00:39:35,580
Feng Xianyu,

693
00:39:37,220 --> 00:39:38,100
not everyone

694
00:39:38,700 --> 00:39:40,580
cares that much about making the list,

695
00:39:41,460 --> 00:39:42,340
more than friendship,

696
00:39:43,260 --> 00:39:43,900
and more than

697
00:39:44,820 --> 00:39:46,820
their own flesh and blood.

698
00:39:50,100 --> 00:39:50,700
Guiniang!

699
00:39:51,620 --> 00:39:52,540
What have you done to her?

700
00:39:53,980 --> 00:39:54,860
Do you still care about her?

701
00:39:56,940 --> 00:39:57,380
Yan Shang!

702
00:39:58,340 --> 00:39:59,580
If you have a problem, come at me!

703
00:40:00,180 --> 00:40:01,060
If you lay a finger on her,

704
00:40:01,740 --> 00:40:03,140
I'll haunt you to my dying day!

705
00:40:07,940 --> 00:40:08,460
Relax.

706
00:40:09,540 --> 00:40:10,740
Your daughter and the old servant

707
00:40:11,340 --> 00:40:12,380
are both safe for now.

708
00:40:13,260 --> 00:40:15,260
I've merely invited them
to stay the night.

709
00:40:22,100 --> 00:40:22,780
However,

710
00:40:24,180 --> 00:40:25,020
after tonight,

711
00:40:25,620 --> 00:40:26,860
when the results are posted tomorrow,

712
00:40:27,740 --> 00:40:28,860
her safety will depend

713
00:40:29,780 --> 00:40:31,220
on what her father

714
00:40:32,700 --> 00:40:33,460
decides to do.

715
00:40:41,820 --> 00:40:43,020
You monster!

716
00:40:48,460 --> 00:40:50,260
Some fool got in my way

717
00:40:51,340 --> 00:40:52,580
and nearly broke my foot!

718
00:40:53,620 --> 00:40:54,100
Are you all right?

719
00:40:55,300 --> 00:40:55,900
I'm only teasing you.

720
00:40:59,100 --> 00:41:00,220
Princess Danyang

721
00:41:00,500 --> 00:41:01,540
is a little more mischievous

722
00:41:01,980 --> 00:41:03,060
than Grand Princess Luling.

723
00:41:04,260 --> 00:41:05,500
Forgive me, Feng Xianyu.

724
00:41:05,740 --> 00:41:06,020
Come on.

725
00:41:16,820 --> 00:41:17,300
Feng Xianyu,

726
00:41:18,420 --> 00:41:20,380
the results won't be posted
for ten hours.

727
00:41:21,860 --> 00:41:22,780
You still have time

728
00:41:23,140 --> 00:41:24,900
to give back what you stole.

729
00:41:25,500 --> 00:41:26,020
Then

730
00:41:26,540 --> 00:41:27,500
we'll call it even,

731
00:41:28,820 --> 00:41:30,380
and Guiniang will be safe.

732
00:41:35,820 --> 00:41:36,260
Farewell.

733
00:41:46,700 --> 00:41:48,980
If I hadn't seen that girl leave myself,

734
00:41:49,300 --> 00:41:50,060
I'd have bought it.

735
00:41:52,420 --> 00:41:54,220
Do you think this is despicable?

736
00:41:54,980 --> 00:41:55,860
Not despicable.

737
00:41:56,860 --> 00:41:57,980
That's strategy.

738
00:41:59,020 --> 00:42:01,540
Especially against
a shameless scoundrel like him,

739
00:42:02,300 --> 00:42:03,860
why should we play fair?

740
00:42:05,580 --> 00:42:08,300
But what if he doesn't care
about his daughter's life

741
00:42:08,820 --> 00:42:10,300
and turns out to be a complete beast?

742
00:42:11,300 --> 00:42:11,860
What then?

743
00:42:13,580 --> 00:42:14,660
Then I'll tell him

744
00:42:14,980 --> 00:42:16,460
I'll write down everything he's done

745
00:42:16,860 --> 00:42:18,820
and have it spread across Sheng'an.

746
00:42:19,420 --> 00:42:20,780
His disgrace will go down in history

747
00:42:21,340 --> 00:42:23,340
and be gossiped about for generations.

748
00:42:23,900 --> 00:42:24,660
He's a scholar.

749
00:42:25,140 --> 00:42:26,780
A lifetime of failure
or disgrace for generations,

750
00:42:27,260 --> 00:42:28,020
he knows which is worse.

751
00:42:29,500 --> 00:42:30,660
How devious.

752
00:42:31,660 --> 00:42:32,260
What a brilliant plan.

753
00:42:34,300 --> 00:42:35,620
By fair means or foul,

754
00:42:35,940 --> 00:42:36,940
we can only do what we can.

755
00:42:37,780 --> 00:42:38,980
Whether we succeed or fail tomorrow

756
00:42:39,700 --> 00:42:40,300
is up to fate.

757
00:42:43,860 --> 00:42:44,380
(Excuse me.)

758
00:42:46,500 --> 00:42:47,020
(Let me through.)

759
00:42:47,020 --> 00:42:47,340
(What's going on?)

760
00:42:48,660 --> 00:42:50,780
Cuiyun Tower's really packed tonight.

761
00:42:54,060 --> 00:42:54,580
Cover for me.

762
00:43:01,700 --> 00:43:02,100
Stop right there!

763
00:43:07,140 --> 00:43:08,020
What are you doing here?

764
00:43:08,260 --> 00:43:08,780
Mr. Yang,

765
00:43:09,260 --> 00:43:10,060
it's been a while.

766
00:43:10,620 --> 00:43:11,820
Don't get chummy with me.

767
00:43:15,820 --> 00:43:16,660
You dare come to a place like this?

768
00:43:18,220 --> 00:43:19,500
You're here too, aren't you?

769
00:43:21,820 --> 00:43:22,300
Yan Shang,

770
00:43:23,020 --> 00:43:24,780
you dare seduce the Princess

771
00:43:24,780 --> 00:43:26,820
while sneaking off to brothels
behind her back?

772
00:43:27,100 --> 00:43:27,940
Have you no shame?

773
00:43:29,900 --> 00:43:31,500
Does coming here mean
visiting courtesans?

774
00:43:31,940 --> 00:43:32,700
Then, are you here

775
00:43:33,220 --> 00:43:34,420
to visit courtesans too?

776
00:43:37,620 --> 00:43:39,100
I owe you no explanation!

777
00:43:48,940 --> 00:43:50,820
You've got a woman
hanging on you right now.

778
00:43:51,300 --> 00:43:52,140
Still denying it?

779
00:43:54,020 --> 00:43:54,500
What do we do?

780
00:43:56,900 --> 00:43:58,380
You're still flirting!

781
00:43:59,260 --> 00:44:00,660
You shameless scoundrel!

782
00:44:02,220 --> 00:44:02,660
What?

783
00:44:03,580 --> 00:44:06,260
Are you going to report me
to the Princess?

784
00:44:10,100 --> 00:44:11,100
What's the point?

785
00:44:12,460 --> 00:44:14,100
You have already bewitched her.

786
00:44:14,740 --> 00:44:15,740
She'd only get upset!

787
00:44:17,020 --> 00:44:19,020
Then thanks for keeping my secret.

788
00:44:20,740 --> 00:44:21,180
Until next time.

789
00:44:54,180 --> 00:44:58,900
(Next Episode Preview)

790
00:44:58,900 --> 00:45:01,860
(Third-Ranked Scholar,
do you have a wife back home?)

791
00:45:02,500 --> 00:45:03,220
Your Majesty,

792
00:45:03,860 --> 00:45:04,340
I do not.

793
00:45:05,420 --> 00:45:06,140
What do you think

794
00:45:06,740 --> 00:45:08,360
of my daughter, Princess Danyang?

795
00:45:14,600 --> 00:45:17,893
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

796
00:45:20,578 --> 00:45:25,494
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

797
00:45:27,688 --> 00:45:33,533
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

798
00:45:34,033 --> 00:45:39,259
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

799
00:45:42,028 --> 00:45:46,819
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

800
00:45:47,655 --> 00:45:53,734
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

801
00:45:55,535 --> 00:45:58,685
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

802
00:45:58,685 --> 00:46:00,333
♪Burning bright as a song♪

803
00:46:00,385 --> 00:46:04,109
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

804
00:46:04,487 --> 00:46:09,153
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

805
00:46:09,772 --> 00:46:13,813
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

806
00:46:14,304 --> 00:46:16,419
♪Not a single hour less♪

807
00:46:16,459 --> 00:46:23,405
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

808
00:46:24,168 --> 00:46:27,621
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

809
00:46:27,801 --> 00:46:30,946
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

810
00:46:31,385 --> 00:46:38,022
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

811
00:46:38,419 --> 00:46:40,457
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

812
00:46:40,457 --> 00:46:42,933
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

813
00:46:42,971 --> 00:46:45,440
♪You're the only one I need♪

814
00:46:45,644 --> 00:46:52,531
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

815
00:46:52,843 --> 00:46:56,114
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

816
00:46:56,419 --> 00:46:59,592
♪My last untouched innocence♪

817
00:46:59,916 --> 00:47:03,342
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

818
00:47:03,575 --> 00:47:06,800
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

819
00:47:07,131 --> 00:47:13,927
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

820
00:47:14,296 --> 00:47:16,358
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

821
00:47:16,359 --> 00:47:18,862
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

822
00:47:18,909 --> 00:47:21,247
♪You're the only one I need♪

823
00:47:21,478 --> 00:47:28,313
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

824
00:47:28,662 --> 00:47:30,280
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

825
00:47:30,410 --> 00:47:32,206
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

826
00:47:32,563 --> 00:47:35,580
♪You're the only one I need♪

827
00:47:35,620 --> 00:47:36,947
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)

